# Every PR touching route configuration requires platform team review.
# This is the enforcement half of the GitOps model (spec §4.1) — CI validation catches malformed
# config, CODEOWNERS catches config that is valid but wrong.
#
# Replace @platform-team with the real GitHub team before this repo takes real traffic.

# Route configuration and environment settings.
/config/                        @platform-team

# Security controls and the decisions behind them.
/docs/security-controls.md      @platform-team
/docs/decisions/                @platform-team

# Deployment and infrastructure.
/deploy/                        @platform-team

# CI, including the config validation gate.
/.github/                       @platform-team

# Later: per-application entries so app teams can review their own route file alongside the
# platform team. One file per application (spec §4.1) exists partly to keep this door open.
# /config/routes/hr-portal.yaml   @platform-team @hr-platform-team
